#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Booking a Doctor's Appointment"
msgstr "Booking a Doctor's Appointment"

#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/making-a-doctors-appointment.ts:16
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Booking a doctor’s appointment usually involves a short conversation with a "
"receptionist. You may need to provide your name, explain the general reason "
"for the visit, choose an available time, and confirm practical details such "
"as the location and required documents.\n"
"\n"
"You do not need to describe your complete medical history to the "
"receptionist. A brief and clear explanation is usually enough to help them "
"choose the correct appointment type.\n"
"\n"
"This roleplay is for language practice only. It does not provide medical "
"diagnosis or treatment advice. If you believe you are experiencing a "
"medical emergency, contact your local emergency service instead of waiting "
"for a routine appointment.\n"
"\n"
"## Start the Call\n"
"\n"
"You can begin with:\n"
"\n"
"- “Hello, I’d like to make an appointment.”\n"
"- “I’m calling to book an appointment with a doctor.”\n"
"- “I’d like to schedule a medical consultation.”\n"
"- “I need to make an appointment for my child.”\n"
"- “I’d like to arrange a follow-up appointment.”\n"
"- “I was asked to call and schedule another visit.”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may ask:\n"
"\n"
"- “Are you already a patient at this clinic?”\n"
"- “May I have your name?”\n"
"- “What is your date of birth?”\n"
"- “Which doctor would you like to see?”\n"
"- “What is the reason for the appointment?”\n"
"- “When are you available?”\n"
"\n"
"## Provide Your Personal Details\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may need information to find or create your patient "
"record.\n"
"\n"
"You may be asked for:\n"
"\n"
"- Your full name\n"
"- Your date of birth\n"
"- Your telephone number\n"
"- Your address\n"
"- Your patient or insurance number\n"
"- Your email address\n"
"- The name of your regular doctor\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “My name is Alex Dmowski.”\n"
"- “My date of birth is the twelfth of May, nineteen ninety.”\n"
"- “I’m already registered at the clinic.”\n"
"- “This will be my first appointment here.”\n"
"- “Could you check whether my details are already in the system?”\n"
"- “My phone number has recently changed.”\n"
"- “Could I spell my surname for you?”\n"
"\n"
"When spelling information over the phone, you can say:\n"
"\n"
"> “That’s D as in Delta, M as in Mike…”\n"
"\n"
"To confirm numbers:\n"
"\n"
"- “That is one-five, not five-zero.”\n"
"- “Let me repeat the number.”\n"
"- “Did you get the complete phone number?”\n"
"- “Could you read that back to me?”\n"
"\n"
"## Explain the Reason for the Appointment\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist usually needs a short description to determine the "
"appropriate doctor, appointment type, and urgency.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’ve had a cough for several days.”\n"
"- “I have been experiencing back pain.”\n"
"- “I’d like to discuss a recurring headache.”\n"
"- “I need a routine check-up.”\n"
"- “I need to renew a prescription.”\n"
"- “I’d like to discuss some test results.”\n"
"- “I need a follow-up after my previous appointment.”\n"
"- “I have a skin problem that I would like a doctor to examine.”\n"
"- “I need a medical certificate.”\n"
"- “I’d like to ask about a vaccination.”\n"
"- “I’m calling about a problem that started yesterday.”\n"
"\n"
"A useful structure is:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’ve been experiencing [general symptom or problem] for [length of "
"time], and I’d like to see a doctor.”\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’ve been experiencing pain in my shoulder for about a week, and it is "
"not improving.”\n"
"\n"
"You do not need to give intimate or highly detailed information to the "
"receptionist. You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “It’s a private medical issue.”\n"
"- “I would prefer to discuss the details directly with the doctor.”\n"
"- “Could you note that it concerns a personal health matter?”\n"
"- “Is a general description enough for the booking?”\n"
"\n"
"## Explain How Urgent It Is\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may ask whether the problem is urgent.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “It is not an emergency, but I would like to be seen soon.”\n"
"- “The symptoms are getting worse.”\n"
"- “I’m in significant discomfort.”\n"
"- “I’m concerned because the problem has continued for several days.”\n"
"- “A doctor asked me to arrange an urgent follow-up.”\n"
"- “I think a routine appointment is sufficient.”\n"
"- “I’m not sure how urgent it is.”\n"
"- “Could a nurse call me to discuss whether I need an earlier appointment?”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may offer:\n"
"\n"
"- A routine appointment\n"
"- A same-day appointment\n"
"- An urgent appointment\n"
"- A telephone consultation\n"
"- A video consultation\n"
"- A nurse consultation\n"
"- An appointment with another available doctor\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist is not always qualified to diagnose the problem. Their "
"role is usually to collect enough information to direct you to the "
"appropriate service.\n"
"\n"
"## Understand Emergency Instructions\n"
"\n"
"A medical office may tell you to contact emergency services instead of "
"waiting for an appointment if your symptoms appear immediately dangerous.\n"
"\n"
"During a real call, follow the clinic’s instructions. Do not rely on a "
"language-learning simulation to decide whether a situation is an emergency.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Do you think I should wait for an appointment?”\n"
"- “Should I speak with a nurse first?”\n"
"- “Is there an urgent care service I should contact?”\n"
"- “Could you repeat the emergency instructions?”\n"
"- “Which number should I call?”\n"
"- “Could you tell me the name of the service?”\n"
"\n"
"If you believe there is an immediate danger to someone’s life or safety, "
"contact the local emergency service.\n"
"\n"
"## Choose the Right Appointment Type\n"
"\n"
"Different concerns may require different types of appointments.\n"
"\n"
"Common options include:\n"
"\n"
"- **Routine appointment** — for a non-urgent medical concern\n"
"- **Urgent appointment** — for a problem that needs quicker assessment\n"
"- **Follow-up appointment** — to review progress after an earlier visit\n"
"- **Telephone consultation** — a conversation with a doctor by phone\n"
"- **Video consultation** — an online appointment with video\n"
"- **In-person consultation** — a visit at the clinic\n"
"- **Nurse appointment** — for services such as dressings, injections, or "
"some routine checks\n"
"- **Specialist appointment** — a consultation with a doctor in a specific "
"medical field\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Do I need an in-person appointment?”\n"
"- “Could this be handled by telephone?”\n"
"- “Is a video consultation available?”\n"
"- “Should I book with a doctor or a nurse?”\n"
"- “Do I need a referral to see the specialist?”\n"
"- “Can any doctor help me, or should I see my regular doctor?”\n"
"- “How long is the appointment?”\n"
"- “Is this the correct type of appointment for my issue?”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask for a Specific Doctor\n"
"\n"
"You may want to see your regular doctor or a doctor with a particular "
"specialty.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’d prefer to see Dr. Avery.”\n"
"- “Is my regular doctor available?”\n"
"- “I have seen Dr. Avery about this problem before.”\n"
"- “Could I book with a female doctor?”\n"
"- “Could I book with a male doctor?”\n"
"- “Is there a doctor who speaks English?”\n"
"- “I need an appointment with a dermatologist.”\n"
"- “Could I see any available doctor?”\n"
"- “I’m happy to see another doctor if I can get an earlier appointment.”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may respond:\n"
"\n"
"- “Your regular doctor is not available this week.”\n"
"- “Another doctor can see you tomorrow.”\n"
"- “The earliest appointment with Dr. Avery is next Tuesday.”\n"
"- “You will need a referral before seeing that specialist.”\n"
"\n"
"## State Your Availability\n"
"\n"
"Be specific about the dates and times that work for you.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’m available on Monday afternoon.”\n"
"- “I can come any morning this week.”\n"
"- “Do you have anything after five?”\n"
"- “I’m not available before three.”\n"
"- “Could I come during my lunch break?”\n"
"- “I would prefer the earliest available appointment.”\n"
"- “Is there anything available today?”\n"
"- “Do you have an appointment tomorrow morning?”\n"
"- “I can be flexible with the time.”\n"
"- “I’m available every day except Thursday.”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may offer:\n"
"\n"
"> “We have an appointment on Wednesday at 10:20 or Friday at 3:45.”\n"
"\n"
"You can respond:\n"
"\n"
"- “Wednesday at 10:20 works for me.”\n"
"- “Could you check whether anything earlier is available?”\n"
"- “Friday would be better.”\n"
"- “Unfortunately, I’ll be at work then.”\n"
"- “Do you have anything later in the day?”\n"
"- “I’ll take the earliest option.”\n"
"\n"
"## Confirm Dates and Times Carefully\n"
"\n"
"Dates and times can be difficult to understand over the phone. Always "
"confirm them.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Did you say Tuesday the fourteenth?”\n"
"- “Was that 9:15 or 9:50?”\n"
"- “Could you repeat the time slowly?”\n"
"- “So the appointment is on Friday at half past two, correct?”\n"
"- “Could you use the twenty-four-hour time?”\n"
"- “Is that appointment in the morning or the afternoon?”\n"
"- “Could you send me a confirmation message?”\n"
"\n"
"It is useful to repeat the final details:\n"
"\n"
"> “Let me confirm: Tuesday, July fourteenth, at 3:30 with Dr. Avery.”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask About the Location\n"
"\n"
"Some clinics operate in more than one building or location.\n"
"\n"
"You can ask:\n"
"\n"
"- “Which clinic is the appointment at?”\n"
"- “Could you give me the address?”\n"
"- “Which floor should I go to?”\n"
"- “Which reception desk should I use?”\n"
"- “Is the entrance accessible?”\n"
"- “Is there parking nearby?”\n"
"- “How early should I arrive?”\n"
"- “Where should I check in?”\n"
"- “Is the appointment at the main clinic or the specialist centre?”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask What to Bring\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the appointment, you may need to bring documents, medication "
"information, or test results.\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “What should I bring with me?”\n"
"- “Do I need identification?”\n"
"- “Should I bring my insurance card?”\n"
"- “Do I need a referral?”\n"
"- “Should I bring my previous test results?”\n"
"- “Do I need a list of my current medications?”\n"
"- “Should I prepare anything before the appointment?”\n"
"- “Do I need to avoid eating before the visit?”\n"
"- “Will you send the instructions by email?”\n"
"\n"
"Do not fast, stop medication, or change treatment based only on "
"assumptions. Ask the clinic for specific instructions.\n"
"\n"
"## Ask About Costs and Insurance\n"
"\n"
"You may need to confirm whether the appointment is covered or requires "
"payment.\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Is this appointment covered by my insurance?”\n"
"- “Do you accept my insurance provider?”\n"
"- “Is there a consultation fee?”\n"
"- “How much will the appointment cost?”\n"
"- “Do I need to pay in advance?”\n"
"- “Can I pay by card?”\n"
"- “Will I receive an invoice?”\n"
"- “Do I need authorization from my insurance company?”\n"
"- “Is there a fee if I cancel?”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may need your insurance or patient number to check "
"coverage.\n"
"\n"
"## Request Language Assistance\n"
"\n"
"If you are not confident speaking the local language, ask whether language "
"support is available.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Do you have a doctor who speaks English?”\n"
"- “Is an interpreter available?”\n"
"- “Can I bring someone to help me translate?”\n"
"- “Could the appointment be conducted in English?”\n"
"- “Could you speak a little more slowly, please?”\n"
"- “I understand some Polish, but I may need help with medical vocabulary.”\n"
"- “Could you send the important information in writing?”\n"
"\n"
"Ask in advance whether another person is allowed to join the appointment.\n"
"\n"
"## Ask for Accessibility Support\n"
"\n"
"You can inform the clinic about any accessibility needs when making the "
"appointment.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “I use a wheelchair. Is the clinic accessible?”\n"
"- “I need step-free access.”\n"
"- “I have difficulty hearing over the phone.”\n"
"- “Could the doctor communicate with me in writing?”\n"
"- “I need additional time for the appointment.”\n"
"- “Can someone help me enter the building?”\n"
"- “Is there an accessible toilet?”\n"
"- “Could you note my accessibility needs on the appointment?”\n"
"\n"
"## Book an Appointment for Someone Else\n"
"\n"
"You may be arranging an appointment for a child, family member, or someone "
"you support.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’m calling to make an appointment for my son.”\n"
"- “I’m arranging the appointment for my mother.”\n"
"- “The patient’s name is…”\n"
"- “I have permission to arrange the appointment.”\n"
"- “Does the patient need to speak with you directly?”\n"
"- “Do you need their consent?”\n"
"- “Can I attend the appointment with them?”\n"
"\n"
"Privacy rules may limit what the clinic can discuss without the patient’s "
"consent.\n"
"\n"
"## Reschedule an Appointment\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot attend, contact the clinic as early as possible.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “I need to reschedule my appointment.”\n"
"- “I’m no longer available at that time.”\n"
"- “Could I move the appointment to another day?”\n"
"- “Do you have anything available next week?”\n"
"- “Could I change it to a telephone consultation?”\n"
"- “I would like to keep the same doctor.”\n"
"- “What is the earliest alternative appointment?”\n"
"\n"
"You may need to provide:\n"
"\n"
"- Your full name\n"
"- Your date of birth\n"
"- The original appointment date\n"
"- The doctor’s name\n"
"- Your patient or booking number\n"
"\n"
"## Cancel an Appointment\n"
"\n"
"To cancel, say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I need to cancel my appointment.”\n"
"- “I will not be able to attend.”\n"
"- “The appointment is on Monday at two.”\n"
"- “Could you confirm that it has been cancelled?”\n"
"- “Is there a cancellation fee?”\n"
"- “Do I need to book another appointment now?”\n"
"- “Could you send me a cancellation confirmation?”\n"
"\n"
"Cancelling early may allow another patient to use the appointment.\n"
"\n"
"## Join a Cancellation List\n"
"\n"
"If no suitable appointment is available, ask whether the clinic has a "
"waiting or cancellation list.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could you add me to the cancellation list?”\n"
"- “Please contact me if an earlier appointment becomes available.”\n"
"- “I can come at short notice.”\n"
"- “How will you contact me?”\n"
"- “How quickly would I need to respond?”\n"
"- “Could you keep my current appointment while I wait for an earlier one?”\n"
"\n"
"## Handle an Unavailable Appointment\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may say:\n"
"\n"
"- “There are no appointments available today.”\n"
"- “The doctor is fully booked.”\n"
"- “The next available appointment is in two weeks.”\n"
"- “Your regular doctor is currently away.”\n"
"- “We only have telephone appointments available.”\n"
"\n"
"You can respond:\n"
"\n"
"- “Is another doctor available?”\n"
"- “Could I speak with a nurse?”\n"
"- “Is there another clinic I can contact?”\n"
"- “Could you add me to the cancellation list?”\n"
"- “What should I do if the symptoms get worse?”\n"
"- “Is there an urgent care service?”\n"
"- “Could I have a telephone consultation first?”\n"
"\n"
"## Confirm the Appointment\n"
"\n"
"Before ending the call, confirm:\n"
"\n"
"- The patient’s name\n"
"- The doctor or healthcare professional\n"
"- The date\n"
"- The time\n"
"- The appointment type\n"
"- The location or call method\n"
"- Anything you need to bring\n"
"- Any preparation instructions\n"
"- The cancellation policy\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could we confirm all the details?”\n"
"- “Who will I be seeing?”\n"
"- “Is this an in-person or telephone appointment?”\n"
"- “Will the doctor call me, or should I call the clinic?”\n"
"- “Which number will the doctor use?”\n"
"- “Should I arrive early?”\n"
"- “Will I receive a text or email confirmation?”\n"
"- “What should I do if I need to cancel?”\n"
"\n"
"## A Simple Appointment Conversation\n"
"\n"
"A typical conversation may look like this:\n"
"\n"
"> **Receptionist:** Good morning. Dr. Avery’s office. How can I help?  \n"
"> **Patient:** Hello, I’d like to make an appointment, please.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Certainly. Are you already registered with the clinic?  "
"\n"
"> **Patient:** Yes. My name is Alex Dmowski.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Thank you. What is the general reason for the "
"appointment?  \n"
"> **Patient:** I’ve had pain in my shoulder for about a week, and it is not "
"improving.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Would you like an in-person appointment?  \n"
"> **Patient:** Yes, please. Do you have anything available this week?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** We have Thursday at 11:20 or Friday at 4:10.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Friday at 4:10 would be better.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** That will be with Dr. Avery at our Central Clinic.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Great. Should I bring anything with me?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Please bring identification and a list of any "
"medication you currently take.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Let me confirm: Friday at 4:10 at the Central Clinic with "
"Dr. Avery.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** That’s correct.\n"
"\n"
"## A Simple Appointment Formula\n"
"\n"
"Follow this structure when booking:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Request:** Say that you want to make an appointment.\n"
"2. **Identify yourself:** Give the required personal details.\n"
"3. **Explain briefly:** State the general reason for the visit.\n"
"4. **Discuss urgency:** Explain whether the issue is routine or needs "
"quicker attention.\n"
"5. **Choose a time:** State your availability and select an appointment.\n"
"6. **Ask practical questions:** Confirm the location, appointment type, "
"costs, and required documents.\n"
"7. **Repeat the details:** Confirm the date, time, doctor, and next steps.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’d like to make an appointment about recurring headaches. It is not an "
"emergency, but I would like to see a doctor this week. I’m available after "
"three on Wednesday or Friday.”\n"
"\n"
"## Practice Scenario\n"
"\n"
"In this roleplay, you are calling Dr. Avery’s office to arrange a medical "
"appointment. The AI receptionist will ask for your details, the general "
"reason for the visit, and your availability.\n"
"\n"
"During the conversation, try to:\n"
"\n"
"- State that you would like to make an appointment.\n"
"- Provide your name and any requested patient details.\n"
"- Briefly explain the reason for the visit.\n"
"- Say whether the problem is routine or needs quicker attention.\n"
"- Ask about in-person, telephone, or video appointment options.\n"
"- Compare at least two available times.\n"
"- Ask what documents or information you should bring.\n"
"- Confirm the appointment date, time, doctor, location, and next steps.\n"
"\n"
"Focus on communicating the necessary information clearly. You do not need "
"to describe private medical details or use advanced medical vocabulary."
msgstr ""
"At bestille en lægetid involverer normalt en kort samtale med en "
"receptionist. Du kan blive bedt om at oplyse dit navn, forklare den "
"generelle årsag til besøget, vælge et ledigt tidspunkt og bekræfte "
"praktiske oplysninger som placering og nødvendige dokumenter.\n"
"\n"
"Du behøver ikke at beskrive din komplette sygdomshistorik for "
"receptionisten. En kort og klar forklaring er normalt nok til at hjælpe dem "
"med at vælge den rigtige type aftale.\n"
"\n"
"Denne rollespil er blot til sprogøvelse. Det giver ikke medicinske "
"diagnoser eller behandlingsråd. Hvis du tror, du oplever en medicinsk "
"nødsituation, skal du kontakte din lokale redningstjeneste i stedet for at "
"vente på en rutineaftale.\n"
"\n"
"## Start Opkaldet\n"
"\n"
"Du kan begynde med:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Hej, jeg vil gerne lave en aftale.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg ringer for at bestille en tid hos en læge.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil gerne planlægge en medicinsk konsultation.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg skal lave en aftale for mit barn.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil gerne arrangere en opfølgningsaftale.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg blev bedt om at ringe og planlægge et nyt besøg.\"\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan spørge:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Er du allerede patient på denne klinik?\"\n"
"- \"Må jeg få dit navn?\"\n"
"- \"Hvad er din fødselsdato?\"\n"
"- \"Hvilken læge ønsker du at se?\"\n"
"- \"Hvad er grunden til aftalen?\"\n"
"- \"Hvornår har du mulighed?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Giv Dine Personlige Oplysninger\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan have brug for oplysninger for at finde eller oprette din "
"patientjournal.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan blive bedt om:\n"
"\n"
"- Dit fulde navn\n"
"- Din fødselsdato\n"
"- Dit telefonnummer\n"
"- Din adresse\n"
"- Din patient- eller forsikringsnummer\n"
"- Din e-mailadresse\n"
"- Navnet på din faste læge\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Mit navn er Alex Dmowski.\"\n"
"- \"Min fødselsdato er den tolvte maj, nittenhalvfems.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg er allerede registreret på klinikken.\"\n"
"- \"Dette vil være min første aftale her.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du tjekke, om mine oplysninger allerede er i systemet?\"\n"
"- \"Mit telefonnummer er for nylig ændret.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg stave mit efternavn for dig?\"\n"
"\n"
"Når du staver information over telefonen, kan du sige:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Det er D som i Delta, M som i Mike...\"\n"
"\n"
"For at bekræfte numre:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Det er et-fem, ikke fem-nul.\"\n"
"- \"Lad mig gentage nummeret.\"\n"
"- \"Fik du det komplette telefonnummer?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du læse det tilbage til mig?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Forklar Årsagen til Aftalen\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten har normalt brug for en kort beskrivelse for at bestemme den "
"relevante læge, aftale type og hastighed.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan sige:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jeg har haft hoste i flere dage.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har oplevet rygsmerter.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil gerne diskutere en tilbagevendende hovedpine.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har brug for et rutinetjek.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har brug for at forny en recept.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil gerne diskutere nogle testresultater.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har brug for en opfølgning efter min tidligere aftale.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har et hudproblem, som jeg gerne vil have en læge til at "
"undersøge.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har brug for en lægeerklæring.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil gerne spørge om en vaccination.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg ringer om et problem, der startede i går.\"\n"
"\n"
"En nyttig struktur er:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Jeg har oplevet [generelt symptom eller problem] i [varighed], og jeg "
"vil gerne se en læge.\"\n"
"\n"
"For eksempel:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Jeg har haft smerter i min skulder i cirka en uge, og det bliver ikke "
"bedre.\"\n"
"\n"
"Du behøver ikke at give intime eller meget detaljerede oplysninger til "
"receptionisten. Du kan sige:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Det er et privat medicinsk problem.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg foretrækker at diskutere detaljerne direkte med lægen.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du note, at det drejer sig om en personlig sundhedsbekymring?\"\n"
"- \"Er en generel beskrivelse nok til at blive booket?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Forklar Hvor Presserende Det Er\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan spørge, om problemet er akut.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Det er ikke en nødsituation, men jeg vil gerne blive set snart.\"\n"
"- \"Symptomerne bliver værre.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har betydelig ubehag.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg er bekymret, fordi problemet har fortsat i flere dage.\"\n"
"- \"En læge bad mig arrangere en akut opfølgning.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg tror, en rutinemæssig aftale er tilstrækkelig.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg er ikke sikker på, hvor presserende det er.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne en sygeplejerske ringe til mig for at diskutere, om jeg har brug "
"for en tidligere aftale?\"\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan tilbyde:\n"
"\n"
"- En rutinemæssig aftale\n"
"- En samme-dags aftale\n"
"- En akut aftale\n"
"- En telefonkonsultation\n"
"- En videokonsultation\n"
"- En sygeplejerskekonsultation\n"
"- En aftale med en anden tilgængelig læge\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten er ikke altid kvalificeret til at diagnosticere problemet. "
"Deres rolle er normalt at indsamle nok information til at lede dig til den "
"korrekte service.\n"
"\n"
"## Forstå Nødinstruktioner\n"
"\n"
"En lægepraksis kan bede dig om at kontakte nødtjenester i stedet for at "
"vente på en aftale, hvis dine symptomer virker øjeblikkeligt farlige.\n"
"\n"
"Under et rigtigt opkald, følg klinikkens instruktioner. Stol ikke på en "
"sprogindlæringssituation til at afgøre, om en situation er en nødsituation.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Tror du, jeg bør vente på en aftale?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg tale med en sygeplejerske først?\"\n"
"- \"Er der en akutpleje tjeneste, jeg skal kontakte?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du gentage nødinstruktionerne?\"\n"
"- \"Hvilket nummer skal jeg ringe til?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du fortælle mig navnet på tjenesten?\"\n"
"\n"
"Hvis du tror, der er en umiddelbar fare for nogens liv eller sikkerhed, "
"skal du kontakte den lokale nødlinje.\n"
"\n"
"## Vælg Den Rette Aftaletype\n"
"\n"
"Forskellige bekymringer kan kræve forskellige typer aftaler.\n"
"\n"
"Almindelige valgmuligheder inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- **Rutinemæssig aftale** — for en ikke-akut medicinsk bekymring\n"
"- **Akut aftale** — for et problem, der kræver hurtigere evaluering\n"
"- **Opfølgende aftale** — for at gennemgå fremskridt efter et tidligere "
"besøg\n"
"- **Telefonkonsultation** — en samtale med en læge pr. telefon\n"
"- **Videokonsultation** — en online aftale med video\n"
"- **Personlig konsultation** — et besøg på klinikken\n"
"- **Sygeplejerskeaftale** — for tjenester som bandagering, injektioner "
"eller nogle rutinetjek\n"
"- **Specialistaftale** — en konsultation med en læge inden for et bestemt "
"medicinsk felt\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige spørgsmål inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Har jeg brug for en personlig aftale?\"\n"
"- \"Kan dette behandles pr. telefon?\"\n"
"- \"Er en videokonsultation tilgængelig?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg booke hos en læge eller en sygeplejerske?\"\n"
"- \"Har jeg brug for en henvisning for at se specialisten?\"\n"
"- \"Kan enhver læge hjælpe mig, eller skal jeg se min faste læge?\"\n"
"- \"Hvor lang er aftalen?\"\n"
"- \"Er denne type aftale rigtig til mit problem?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Bed Om En Specifik Læge\n"
"\n"
"Du ønsker måske at se din faste læge eller en læge med en bestemt "
"specialitet.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan sige:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil helst se Dr. Avery.\"\n"
"- \"Er min faste læge tilgængelig?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har set Dr. Avery om dette problem før.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg booke hos en kvindelig læge?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg booke hos en mandlig læge?\"\n"
"- \"Er der en læge, der taler engelsk?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har brug for en aftale med en hudlæge.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg se en hvilken som helst ledig læge?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg er glad for at se en anden læge, hvis jeg kan få en tidligere "
"aftale.\"\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan svare:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Din faste læge er ikke tilgængelig denne uge.\"\n"
"- \"En anden læge kan se dig i morgen.\"\n"
"- \"Den tidligste aftale med Dr. Avery er næste tirsdag.\"\n"
"- \"Du skal have en henvisning, før du ser den specialist.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Angiv Din Tilgængelighed\n"
"\n"
"Vær specifik omkring de datoer og tidspunkter, der passer dig.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jeg er tilgængelig mandag eftermiddag.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg kan komme hver morgen denne uge.\"\n"
"- \"Har du noget efter klokken fem?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg er ikke tilgængelig før klokken tre.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg komme i frokostpausen?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg ville foretrække den tidligste ledige aftale.\"\n"
"- \"Er der noget ledigt i dag?\"\n"
"- \"Har du en tid tilgængelig i morgen tidlig?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg kan være fleksibel med tiden.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg er tilgængelig hver dag undtagen torsdag.\"\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan tilbyde:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Vi har en aftale onsdag kl. 10:20 eller fredag kl. 3:45.\"\n"
"\n"
"Du kan svare:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Onsdag kl. 10:20 passer mig.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du tjekke, om noget tidligere er tilgængeligt?\"\n"
"- \"Fredag ville være bedre.\"\n"
"- \"Desværre, jeg er på arbejde der.\"\n"
"- \"Har du noget senere på dagen?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg tager den tidligste mulighed.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Bekræft Datoer og Tider Omhyggeligt\n"
"\n"
"Datoer og tider kan være svære at forstå over telefonen. Bekræft dem altid.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Sagde du tirsdag den fjortende?\"\n"
"- \"Var det 9:15 eller 9:50?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du gentage tidspunktet langsomt?\"\n"
"- \"Så aftalen er fredag kl. halv tre, korrekt?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du bruge 24-timers tid?\"\n"
"- \"Er den aftale om morgenen eller eftermiddagen?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du sende mig en bekræftelsesbesked?\"\n"
"\n"
"Det er nyttigt at gentage de endelige detaljer:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Lad mig bekræfte: Tirsdag den fjortende juli kl. 3:30 med Dr. Avery.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Spørg Om Placeringen\n"
"\n"
"Nogle klinikker opererer i mere end én bygning eller lokation.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan spørge:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Hvilken klinik er aftalen på?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du give mig adressen?\"\n"
"- \"Hvilken etage skal jeg gå til?\"\n"
"- \"Hvilket receptionsskranke skal jeg bruge?\"\n"
"- \"Er indgangen tilgængelig?\"\n"
"- \"Er der parkering i nærheden?\"\n"
"- \"Hvor tidligt skal jeg ankomme?\"\n"
"- \"Hvor skal jeg tjekke ind?\"\n"
"- \"Er aftalen på hovedklinikken eller specialistcentret?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Spørg Hvad Du Skal Medbringe\n"
"\n"
"Afhængig af aftalen kan du have brug for at medbringe dokumenter, "
"medicininformation eller testresultater.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige spørgsmål inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Hvad skal jeg medbringe?\"\n"
"- \"Har jeg brug for legitimation?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg medbringe mit forsikringskort?\"\n"
"- \"Har jeg brug for en henvisning?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg medbringe mine tidligere testresultater?\"\n"
"- \"Har jeg brug for en liste over mine nuværende medicin?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg forberede noget inden aftalen?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg undgå at spise før besøget?\"\n"
"- \"Vil du sende instrukser via e-mail?\"\n"
"\n"
"Du må ikke faste, stoppe medicin eller ændre behandlingen kun baseret på "
"antagelser. Spørg klinikken om specifikke instruktioner.\n"
"\n"
"## Spørg Om Omkostninger og Forsikring\n"
"\n"
"Du skal muligvis bekræfte, om aftalen er dækket eller kræver betaling.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige spørgsmål inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Er denne aftale dækket af min forsikring?\"\n"
"- \"Accepterer I min forsikringsudbyder?\"\n"
"- \"Er der et konsultationsgebyr?\"\n"
"- \"Hvor meget koster aftalen?\"\n"
"- \"Har jeg brug for at betale på forhånd?\"\n"
"- \"Kan jeg betale med kort?\"\n"
"- \"Vil jeg modtage en faktura?\"\n"
"- \"Har jeg brug for autorisation fra mit forsikringsselskab?\"\n"
"- \"Er der et gebyr, hvis jeg aflyser?\"\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan have brug for dit forsikrings- eller patientnummer for "
"at kontrollere dækning.\n"
"\n"
"## Anmod Om Sproglig Assistance\n"
"\n"
"Hvis du ikke er sikker på at tale det lokale sprog, skal du spørge om der "
"er sproglig støtte tilgængelig.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan sige:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Har I en læge, der taler engelsk?\"\n"
"- \"Er der en tolk tilgængelig?\"\n"
"- \"Kan jeg tage nogen med til at hjælpe mig med at oversætte?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne aftalen gennemføres på engelsk?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du tale lidt langsommere, tak?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg forstår noget polsk, men jeg har måske brug for hjælp med medicinsk "
"ordforråd.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du sende de vigtige oplysninger skriftligt?\"\n"
"\n"
"Spørg på forhånd, om en anden person må deltage i aftalen.\n"
"\n"
"## Bed Om Tilgængelighedssupport\n"
"\n"
"Du kan informere klinikken om eventuelle tilgængelighedsbehov, når du laver "
"en aftale.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jeg bruger kørestol. Er klinikken tilgængelig?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har brug for trin-fri adgang.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har svært ved at høre over telefonen.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne lægen kommunikere med mig skriftligt?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har brug for ekstra tid til aftalen.\"\n"
"- \"Kan nogen hjælpe mig ind i bygningen?\"\n"
"- \"Er der et tilgængeligt toilet?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du notere mine tilgængelighedsbehov på aftalen?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Bestil En Aftale For Nogen Anden\n"
"\n"
"Du arrangerer måske en aftale til et barn, et familiemedlem eller en "
"person, du støtter.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan sige:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jeg ringer for at lave en aftale til min søn.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg arrangerer aftalen for min mor.\"\n"
"- \"Patientens navn er...\"\n"
"- \"Jeg har tilladelse til at arrangere aftalen.\"\n"
"- \"Skal patienten tale direkte med dig?\"\n"
"- \"Har I brug for deres samtykke?\"\n"
"- \"Kan jeg deltage i aftalen med dem?\"\n"
"\n"
"Privatregler kan begrænse, hvad klinikken kan diskutere uden patientens "
"samtykke.\n"
"\n"
"## Ombestil En Aftale\n"
"\n"
"Hvis du ikke kan deltage, skal du kontakte klinikken så tidligt som muligt.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jeg skal ombestille min aftale.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg er ikke længere tilgængelig på det tidspunkt.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg flytte aftalen til en anden dag?\"\n"
"- \"Har du noget ledigt næste uge?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg ændre den til en telefonkonsultation?\"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil gerne beholde den samme læge.\"\n"
"- \"Hvad er den tidligste alternative aftale?\"\n"
"\n"
"Du kan blive bedt om at oplyse:\n"
"\n"
"- Dit fulde navn\n"
"- Din fødselsdato\n"
"- Den oprindelige aftaledato\n"
"- Lægens navn\n"
"- Dit patient- eller bookingnummer\n"
"\n"
"## Aflys En Aftale\n"
"\n"
"For at aflyse, sig:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jeg skal aflyse min aftale.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg vil ikke kunne deltage.\"\n"
"- \"Aftalen er mandag klokken to.\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du bekræfte, at den er blevet aflyst?\"\n"
"- \"Er der et aflysningsgebyr?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg lave en ny aftale nu?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du sende mig en aflysningsbekræftelse?\"\n"
"\n"
"At aflyse tidligt kan gøre det muligt for en anden patient at benytte "
"aftalen.\n"
"\n"
"## Kom på En Aflysningsliste\n"
"\n"
"Hvis der ikke er nogen passende aftale tilgængelig, så spørg, om klinikken "
"har en venteliste eller aflysningsliste.\n"
"\n"
"Nyttige fraser inkluderer:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Kunne du tilføje mig til aflysningslisten?\"\n"
"- \"Venligst kontakt mig, hvis der bliver en tidligere aftale "
"tilgængelig.\"\n"
"- \"Jeg kan komme med kort varsel.\"\n"
"- \"Hvordan vil du kontakte mig?\"\n"
"- \"Hvor hurtigt skal jeg reagere?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du beholde min nuværende aftale, mens jeg venter på en "
"tidligere?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Håndter En Utilgængelig Aftale\n"
"\n"
"Receptionisten kan sige:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Der er ingen aftaler ledige i dag.\"\n"
"- \"Lægen er fuldt booket.\"\n"
"- \"Den næste ledige aftale er om to uger.\"\n"
"- \"Din faste læge er i øjeblikket væk.\"\n"
"- \"Vi har kun telefonmøder tilgængelige.\"\n"
"\n"
"Du kan svare:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Er der en anden læge tilgængelig?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg tale med en sygeplejerske?\"\n"
"- \"Er der en anden klinik, jeg kan kontakte?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne du tilføje mig til aflysningslisten?\"\n"
"- \"Hvad skal jeg gøre, hvis symptomerne bliver værre?\"\n"
"- \"Er der en akutplejetjeneste?\"\n"
"- \"Kunne jeg få en telefonkonsultation først?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Bekræft Aftalen\n"
"\n"
"Før du afslutter opkaldet, skal du bekræfte:\n"
"\n"
"- Patientens navn\n"
"- Lægen eller sundhedspersonalet\n"
"- Datoen\n"
"- Tidspunktet\n"
"- Aftaletypen\n"
"- Placeringen eller opkaldsmetoden\n"
"- Alt hvad du skal medbringe\n"
"- Eventuelle forberedelsesinstruktioner\n"
"- Aflysningspolitikken\n"
"\n"
"Du kan sige:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Kunne vi bekræfte alle detaljerne?\"\n"
"- \"Hvem vil jeg se?\"\n"
"- \"Er dette en personlig eller telefonkonsultation?\"\n"
"- \"Vil lægen ringe til mig, eller skal jeg ringe til klinikken?\"\n"
"- \"Hvilket nummer vil lægen bruge?\"\n"
"- \"Skal jeg ankomme tidligt?\"\n"
"- \"Vil jeg modtage en sms eller e-mailbekræftelse?\"\n"
"- \"Hvad skal jeg gøre, hvis jeg har brug for at aflyse?\"\n"
"\n"
"## En Enkel Aftalesamtale\n"
"\n"
"En typisk samtale kan se sådan ud:\n"
"\n"
"> **Receptionist:** Godmorgen. Dr. Averys kontor. Hvordan kan jeg hjælpe?  \n"
"> **Patient:** Hej, jeg vil gerne lave en aftale, tak.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Naturligvis. Er du allerede registreret ved klinikken?  "
"\n"
"> **Patient:** Ja. Mit navn er Alex Dmowski.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Tak. Hvad er den generelle årsag til aftalen?  \n"
"> **Patient:** Jeg har haft smerter i min skulder i cirka en uge, og det "
"bliver ikke bedre.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Vil du have en personlig aftale?  \n"
"> **Patient:** Ja, tak. Har du noget tilgængeligt i denne uge?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Vi har torsdag kl. 11:20 eller fredag kl. 4:10.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Fredag kl. 4:10 ville være bedre.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Det vil være med Dr. Avery på vores Central Klinik.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Fint. Skal jeg medbringe noget med mig?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Medbring venligst identifikation og en liste over "
"eventuel medicin, du aktuelt tager.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Lad mig bekræfte: fredag kl. 4:10 på Central Klinik med Dr. "
"Avery.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Det er korrekt.\n"
"\n"
"## En Enkel Aftale Formel\n"
"\n"
"Følg denne struktur, når du booker:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Anmodning:** Sig, at du ønsker at lave en aftale.\n"
"2. **Identificer dig selv:** Giv de nødvendige personlige oplysninger.\n"
"3. **Forklar kort:** Nævn den generelle årsag til besøget.\n"
"4. **Diskuter hastighed:** Forklar, om problemet er rutinemæssigt eller "
"kræver hurtigere opmærksomhed.\n"
"5. **Vælg et tidspunkt:** Angiv din tilgængelighed og vælg en aftale.\n"
"6. **Spørg praktiske spørgsmål:** Bekræft placering, aftaletype, "
"omkostninger og nødvendige dokumenter.\n"
"7. **Gentag detaljerne:** Bekræft datoen, tiden, lægen og næste skridt.\n"
"\n"
"For eksempel:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Jeg vil gerne lave en aftale om tilbagevendende hovedpine. Det er ikke "
"en nødsituation, men jeg vil gerne se en læge i denne uge. Jeg er "
"tilgængelig efter tre på onsdag eller fredag.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Øvelsesscenario\n"
"\n"
"I denne rollespil ringer du til Dr. Averys kontor for at arrangere en "
"medicinsk aftale. AI-receptionisten vil bede om dine detaljer, den "
"generelle årsag til besøget og din tilgængelighed.\n"
"\n"
"Under samtalen, prøv at:\n"
"\n"
"- Angiv, at du gerne vil lave en aftale.\n"
"- Giv dit navn og eventuelle efterspurgte patientoplysninger.\n"
"- Forklar kort årsagen til besøget.\n"
"- Sig, om problemet er rutinemæssigt eller har brug for hurtigere "
"opmærksomhed.\n"
"- Spørg om personlige, telefoniske eller videoaftale muligheder.\n"
"- Sammenlign mindst to tilgængelige tidspunkter.\n"
"- Spørg hvad dokumenter eller information, du skal medbringe.\n"
"- Bekræft aftalens dato, tid, læge, placering og næste skridt.\n"
"\n"
"Fokus på at kommunikere den nødvendige information tydeligt. Du behøver "
"ikke beskrive private medicinske detaljer eller bruge avanceret medicinsk "
"ordforråd."

